# NO-INPUT · TWO BANDS
# Two continuously excited, cross-coupled resonant returns.
# b = band centres Hz, q = reciprocal Q, k = drive before tanh.
# d and g accept left,right; x adds the other channel's output.
# v is outside the return path. Cmd+. or Escape stops all audio.
# Try b145,620 g0.82,0.75 k4, then apply with Cmd+Enter.
!vc
{
 n2v0.03p-1'24e0
 n1v0.03p1'24e0
